obj_id: agentGenerated_MonthlySalesTrendsKPIDashboard-a25bbc79
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_Monthly Sales Trends KPI Dashboard
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 18c18cb3-600f-433a-9432-fd2d6c17f36e
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • March consistently shows highest growth across all years (1,132% in 2021, 224% in 2022, 125% in 2023, 190% in 2024)
        • September demonstrates strong seasonal pattern with 193% growth in 2021 and 136% in 2023
        • Sales volatility decreased from 2021 to 2024, indicating more predictable business patterns
        • November shows consistent holiday season strength with 142% growth in 2022

        Recommendations:
        • Increase inventory and marketing spend in February to capitalize on March growth pattern
        • Develop September promotional campaigns to amplify existing seasonal momentum
